  m_Name: Files 02 - Audios Force To Mono
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    name: Set Audios to Force To Mono
    description: "<b>\u2022 What It Does:</b> Converts stereo audio clips into mono,
      reducing file size and the number of audio channels processed at runtime.\n\n<b>\u2022
      Our Modification: </b>We force audio clips to mono wherever spatialization
      or stereo panning is not required. This lowers memory use and reduces audio
      processing overhead, which is critical on performance-limited VR devices."
